abstract: >-
  Reproducible numerical study of global and local spectral statistics of
  Gram matrices W2^T W2 during training of multilayer perceptrons, including
  true-label and shuffled-label controls, finite-size scaling, random-matrix
  controls, and seed-level statistical inference.
